
title: CarStart
---
<<checkWheels GameController>>

<<if $carQuestStarted == false>>
    <<jump BrokenCar>>
<<elseif $wheelsCollected < 4>>
    <<jump FindWheels>>
<<else>>
    <<jump AllWheels>>
<<endif>>
===

title: BrokenCar
---
Sagunn: Finally, a car.
Sagunn: I need to get downtown.
Sagunn: If this thing still works, I might actually get out of here!
Sagunn: ...
Sagunn: All four of the wheels are missing.
Sagunn: How does someone even lose all four wheels?
Sagunn: The rest of the car looks fine, at least.
Sagunn: They have to be somewhere around this warehouse.
Sagunn: Guess I'll have to look around to find out.

<<startCarQuest GameController>>
===

title: FindWheels
---
Sagunn: Still missing some wheels.
Sagunn: I should look around more.
Sagunn: There are boxes and shelves everywhere.
Sagunn: Someone could have left them in just about any corner of this place.

<<if $wheelsCollected == 0>>
    Sagunn: Haven't found a single one yet.
    Sagunn: I should probably start checking behind those shelves.
    Sagunn: They can't have just disappeared.
<<elseif $wheelsCollected == 1>>
    Sagunn: One down, three more to go.
    Sagunn: At least I know there are wheels lying around here.
    Sagunn: Hopefully the others aren't too far away.
<<elseif $wheelsCollected == 2>>
    Sagunn: Two wheels. Halfway there.
    Sagunn: Just need to keep searching.
<<elseif $wheelsCollected == 3>>
    Sagunn: Just one more wheel.
    Sagunn: Now where could it be...
<<endif>>
===

title: AllWheels
---
Sagunn: That's all four wheels!
Sagunn: Took me long enough to find them.
Sagunn: Now I just need to put them back on the car.
Sagunn: Hopefully the engine still works after all this time.

-> Repair the car.
    Sagunn: Alright, let's get these wheels back where they belong.
    <<repairCar GameController>>
    Sagunn: Looks like it's ready.
    Sagunn: Not bad. I honestly didn't think I'd get this thing working.
    Sagunn: Now I just need to hope there's enough gas in the tank.
    Sagunn: Finally, I can get downtown.
===
